From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LuneOS / webOS Ports <team@webos-ports.org>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] google: add absl_strings to the TTS_ENGINE link

Same class as 0001, one abseil release later. abseil 2601 moved more of what
the generated protobuf/grpc stubs reference into libabsl_strings:

  libabsl_strings.so.2601.0.0: error adding symbols: DSO missing from
  command line

This dependency list is hardcoded rather than taken from the installed CMake
config, so every abseil split has to be added by hand.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 src/engines/tts/google/CMakeLists.txt | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/engines/tts/google/CMakeLists.txt b/src/engines/tts/google/CMakeLists.txt
index a766540..7f7169a 100755
--- a/src/engines/tts/google/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/engines/tts/google/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -27,6 +27,7 @@ set(src ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/GoogleTTSEngine.cpp
 )
  set(deps
      gpr
+     absl_strings
      absl_city
      absl_cord
      absl_cordz_info
